### Requetes de test (VS Code "REST Client" ou IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = COLLE_LE_TOKEN_ICI

### 0. (dev) mettre "password123" a tous les users du seed
POST {{base}}/api/dev/reset-passwords
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "password123" }

### 1. Login (user 1 du seed)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "amine.bensalah@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### 2. Register
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Test", "lastName": "User", "email": "test@example.com", "password": "secret123",
  "sex": "M", "roleId": 4, "clubId": 1 }

### Moi
GET {{base}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roles / clubs (id 0 = ALL)
GET {{base}}/api/roles

### Feed
GET {{base}}/api/feed?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Creer un post (visible par tout le monde)
POST {{base}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Reunion SOS samedi 10h !", "visibleRoleId": 0, "visibleClubId": 1 }

### Like
POST {{base}}/api/posts/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Commenter
POST {{base}}/api/posts/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Je serai la" }

### Commentaires d'un post
GET {{base}}/api/posts/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Amis
GET {{base}}/api/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Demande d'ami au user 5
POST {{base}}/api/friends/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Demandes recues
GET {{base}}/api/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Conversations
GET {{base}}/api/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ouvrir une conversation avec un ami (user 2)
POST {{base}}/api/conversations/with/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Envoyer un message
POST {{base}}/api/conversations/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Salut !" }

### Notifications
GET {{base}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nb non vues
GET {{base}}/api/notifications/unseen-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### File d'events (debug)
GET {{base}}/api/internal/events?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
